## Business Rule

```text
1 Face
   │
   ├── No active visit
   │       ↓
   │   Create 1 visit
   │
   └── Active visit exists
           ↓
       Do NOT create another visit
```

A visitor may have multiple historical visits, but **cannot have two visits whose active session periods overlap**.

```text
Visitor A

Visit 1 ────────────────┐
                        │
                        │ NO SECOND VISIT
                        │ DURING THIS PERIOD
                        │
                        └────────────────────

After Visit 1 expires:

Visit 2 ────────────────┐
                        │
                        └────────────────────
```
